ObjectPropertyAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3139985") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Surveillance of Environmental Aspects Related to Cancer in Humans (SEARCH) study [11] was a collaborative study of the International Agency for Research on Cancer including 810 cases and 1679 controls matched by age and sex collected in the 1980s in Toronto and Montreal, Canada, Utrecht, The Netherlands, Opole, Poland and Adelaide, Australia, based upon a random sample from the population at risk.") <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/has_data_collection_location> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001387> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Poland>)
